WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Don't rush, gather the materials first

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:02,760
As long as the material is enough

3
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:04,360
The space problem can be solved naturally

4
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,400
Xu Bo can reveal the expansion drawings

5
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,440
Surely others can too

6
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:09,000
I have enough supplies in hand

7
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:10,160
Definitely available

8
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:13,160
What is the other drawing?

9
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:15,520
An accumulated drawing of a hundred swords

10
00:00:16,190 --> 00:00:18,350
I originally wanted another crossbow protection blueprint.

11
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:21,910
Uncle Xu and the others are unwilling to let the crossbow guard

12
00:00:22,390 --> 00:00:24,110
assault weapons pair

13
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:25,390
The crossbow in the room now

14
00:00:25,390 --> 00:00:27,630
If the door is forced, it will automatically attack outsiders.

15
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:30,230
It's a pity that I can't take away 70% of the revenue from them.

16
00:00:30,230 --> 00:00:31,790
Can add an extra layer of defense inside the door

17
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:33,070
It's really good stuff

18
00:00:33,630 --> 00:00:35,590
It seems that Uncle Xu and the others have made a lot of money today.

19
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:37,470
Have at least two or three drawings in hand

20
00:00:38,890 --> 00:00:40,130
And I seriously doubt it

21
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:43,330
They must have hidden some resources that they haven't released yet, no doubt about it.

22
00:00:43,650 --> 00:00:45,210
They must be hiding a lot of things

23
00:00:45,450 --> 00:00:46,870
Obviously our role is the greatest

24
00:00:47,070 --> 00:00:49,150
If it weren't for us, the monster that caused the whole road

25
00:00:49,150 --> 00:00:50,470
They can sneak up so easily

26
00:00:50,670 --> 00:00:52,070
It’s just not sure how many people will die.
